--- stderr
Migrated legacy.plumber.yaml → migrated.yaml
  - renamed github.controls.releaseWorkflowsMustNotRestoreUntrustedCache to untrustedTriggersMustNotWriteCache
  - dropped publishActions, cacheActions (the control no longer detects release jobs)
Review the result, then replace the original with:
  mv migrated.yaml legacy.plumber.yaml

--- file migrated.yaml
# Legacy control name, renamed by `plumber config migrate`.
version: "2.0"
github:
  controls:
    workflowsMustDeclarePermissions:
      enabled: true
    # Cache poisoning
    untrustedTriggersMustNotWriteCache:
      enabled: false
    pipelineMustNotEnableDebugTrace:
      enabled: true

